@110 = ~It is one of the runes needed to validate victory in Telim'Gar's Insurmountable Challenges.~
@111 = ~This is the finaaal rune, the day of glory has arrived... You have triumphed over the insurmountable challenges of Telim'Gar, and this rune will allow you to bring the adventure to a definitive end by returning to the primary plane. However, there will probably be no bard to hear of your exploits and compose an epic ballad about them.~
